  "details": "0. Log out of VRChat if not already.\n\n1. Launch VRChat in VR.\n\n2. Use Login with Email/Password option.\n\n3. Notice that shift/uppercase cannot be used on the keyboard. The keyboard re-plays the show animation and resets the caps state.\n\nThis makes it currently impossible to type most passwords in VR for login.",
